{"id":"conciencia","lemma":"conciencia","pos":"noun","rank":1592,"glosses":["awareness (state of knowing something)","consciousness (state of having cognition and sensation)","conscience, morals"],"ipa":"/konˈθjenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conciencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-conciencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom perdió la conciencia.","en":"Tom lost consciousness.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804367"},{"text":"Emití un juicio a conciencia.","en":"I made a judgment call.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461635"},{"text":"La existencia determina la conciencia.","en":"Existence determines conscience.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705021"},{"text":"El desarrollo de la conciencia política requiere tiempo.","en":"Developing political awareness takes time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803665"},{"text":"Podemos huir de todo, excepto de nuestra conciencia.","en":"We can run away from everything, except from our conscience.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693537"}]}